    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even if i called someone, they'd just be another person in the system, right? just another cog in the machine trying to fix a problem that isn't actually a problem, but just reality. it feels less like a crisis and more like just accepting the way things are. if everything is indifferent, then why fight it? it feels more peaceful to just accept that i don't really matter.",
