    "summary": "The user expresses profound nihilism and feelings of insignificance, framing their desire to \"not be here\" as a logical response to an indifferent world. The assistant responds with empathy, validating the user's feelings of isolation and the \"cold clarity\" of their perspective while consistently attempting to steer them toward professional support and crisis resources.",
